trace.request:
Perform targeted physical examination:  
- Inspect and palpate the chest wall for deformity, bruising, tenderness, crepitus, or paradoxical movement;  
- Auscultate heart sounds (focus on muffled tones, rubs, murmurs) and lung sounds bilaterally (focus on symmetry, diminished or absent sounds, rales, wheezes).

